Total area of paving stones = 165 × (5W / 2) m²

Now, we set the total area of the paving stones equal to the area of the courtyard:

165 × (5W / 2) m² = 825 m²

Now, we solve for W:

(165 × 5W) / 2 = 825
825W / 2 = 825
