     - \( n = 9 \) is valid (since \( 9 > 7 \))
     - \( n = 18 \) is valid (since \( 18 > 7 \))
     - \( n = 27 \) is valid (since \( 27 > 7 \))
     - \( n = 54 \) is valid (since \( 54 > 7 \))

5. **Counting the Valid Divisors**:
