A ferry boat transports visitors to a resort starting at 9 AM until the final ride at 5 PM, on an hourly schedule. On the initial 9 AM trip, there are 120 visitors and with each subsequent trip, the number of visitors decreases by 2. Determine the total number of visitors carried to the resort that particular day.
