The transfer-loop gain is \( A_{tf} = A_v \times m_v = 100 \times 0.1 = 10 \).

The closed-loop voltage gain without feedback is given by:
\[
A_{vf} = \frac{A_v}{1 - A_tv} = \frac{100}{1 - 100 \times 0.1} = \frac{100}{1 - 10} = \frac{100}{-9} = -11.11 \text{ V}
\]

