","The quantum annealing algorithm is a heuristic algorithm for solving combinatorial optimization problems. Unlike brute-force classical algorithms that explore all possible configurations, quantum annealing uses quantum annealing to find the lowest-energy state of a physical system, which corresponds to the optimal solution of the optimization problem. 

