θ = nθ/d
θ = 3 * (600 nm) / (1.25 x 10^-6 m)
θ = 3 * (600 x 10^-6 m) / (1.25 x 10^-6 m)
θ = 1800 x 10^-6 m / 1.25 x 10^-6 m
θ = 1440 degrees

So, the angle between the central maximum and the third order maximum is 1440 degrees.",fluency,"# Task Description
