   - \( N_2 \) is the number of turns in coil 2.
   - \( I_1(t) \) is the instantaneous current in coil 1.
   - \( \mu_1 \) and \( \mu_2 \) are the magnetic permeativity of the coils.
   - \( \ell \) is the circumference of the axial circles of the tortors.
   - \( A \) is the cross-sectional area of the tortoals.

