   \[
   \mathbf{J} = \mathbf{\sigma} \mathbf{E}
   \]
   where \( \mathbf{\sigma} \) is the electric conductivity tensor. This can be expressed in component form as:
   \[
   J_i = \sum_{j=1}^N \sigma_{ij} E_j
   \]
